                                "sense_id": "2769da18-70c2-325c-94e4-7bc8934e3356",
                                "text": "Separate research suggests a switch from the flaring of methane to venting may be behind some of these vast outpourings. […] Venting simply releases the invisible methane into the air unburned, which, until recent developments in satellite technology, had been hard to detect."
